,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: 4.4.stable, 4.4.1.stable, 4.5.dev3\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7602) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-13500HX (20 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn SoftBody3D, the mesh vertices that have a spatial attachment are expected to strictly maintain their relative position to a Node3D. This is true for GodotPhysics, however when using Jolt, the vertices that are pinned to a moving node lag behind their expected positions. The lag is proportional to the speed of the node, and disappears when it stops.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Set Jolt Physics as the physics engine\n2. Create a SoftBody3D and a CharacterBody3D/RigidBody3D\n3. Attach SoftBody3D to the physics body\n4. Move the physics body\nAs velocity increases, pinned vertices are being displaced from the point of attachment.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThe reproduction is not project dependent, but the MRP provides a reference bounding box to clearly observe the lag.\n[softbody_lag.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20157299/softbody_lag.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106301/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106301/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}